  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The eyes are glossy lenses (lo_eyes) with the amber iris, the big pupil, two catchlights and the upper lash line baked into the body atlas; the brows, the blush, the freckles and the nostrils are baked into the body; the two rounded fangs are props on the head. The lips are cut along the smile and an inner mouth (palate, tongue, throat) sits behind them: the jaw opens it in idle_happy, win, the strike and the hits. No face sheet and no morphs: expressions in the clips are hints only. Blinking scales the blink bones (play blink over any clip): each lens squashes onto the closed lid lash line and sinks into the head.",
